# Import Excel for Dropping & Permintaan

The user needs to bulk-import weekly data (M1-M4) for both the `/dropping` and `/permintaan` pages from Excel files.

## Excel Format Expected

Simple format with columns: `item_sub_kriteria`, `M1`, `M2`, `M3`, `M4`

| item_sub_kriteria | M1 | M2 | M3 | M4 |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Gaji dan Tunjangan | 0 | 0 | 6300168 | 0 |
| Cuti Tahunan | 0 | 0 | 148012 | 0 |
| PPh pasal 21 | 941566 | 0 | 0 | 0 |

Items are matched by name to `item_sub_kriteria` in the database. Missing items are skipped.

## Proposed Changes

### Import Class

#### [NEW] [ImportDropping.php](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Downloads/CASH_BANK/CASH_BANK/app/Imports/ImportDropping.php)

A reusable import class that accepts `target` (dropping/permintaan), `sub_kriteria`, `bulan`, `tahun` as constructor params. Matches items by name, upserts M1-M4 values.

